Description:It is your first main phase. You control Raging Goblin (1/1 haste) with two +1/+1 counters on it, and a tapped Hill Giant. You have Phantasmal Image in hand with two blue mana floating. The opponent is at 4 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-copy-haste-no-counters | A copy takes the copiable values, including keywords such as haste, but not counters (CR 707.2, 702.10): Phantasmal Image copying Raging Goblin is a 1/1 with haste that attacks beside the 3/3 Goblin for exactly 4; copying the bigger Hill Giant gives a creature that can't attack this turn
